VALUES (
    'SEC-SQL-RAN-045-RC01', 'SEC-SQL-RAN-045', 'Backup repository / Veeam server compromise',
    'ran-045-backup-repository-veeam-server-compromise', '2026 Veeam CVEs (CVE-2026-21666 / 21667 / 21668) give an authenticated domain user RCE on the backup server or arbitrary file manipulation in the repository. Qilin specifically hits Veeam credential DBs first. Detection: archiver continuity + operator-supplied repo state.',
