    'ran-049-sql-server-database-mail-service-broker-abuse', 'Database Mail = outbound-SMTP exfil channel; Service Broker queues = quiet C2. Microsoft documented this exact path in their 2023 SQL-Server-to-cloud-lateral writeup.',
