VALUES (
    'SEC-SQL-RAN-050-RC01', 'SEC-SQL-RAN-050', 'Connection pooler compromise',
    'ran-050-connection-pooler-compromise', 'PgBouncer < 1.25.1 has CVE-2025-12819: unauthenticated SQL injection via the SCRAM startup-message `search_path`. Pre-auth RCE on the front of every PostgreSQL connection. Multiple pre-auth integer-overflow CVEs also crash the pooler with one malformed packet.',
