VALUES (
    'SEC-SQL-RAN-051-RC01', 'SEC-SQL-RAN-051', 'Hostile logical-replication subscription',
    'ran-051-hostile-logical-replication-subscription', 'attacker creates a `pg_subscription` from their own host. Every commit streams to them in real time. CVE-2026-6638 in `ALTER SUBSCRIPTION ... REFRESH PUBLICATION` further auto-escalates to publication-side superuser.',
