    'ran-053-stored-procedure-function-body-obfuscation', 'Oracle PL/SQL wrapped via `DBMS_DDL.WRAP`, SQL Server objects created `WITH ENCRYPTION` (definition reads as NULL), PostgreSQL functions whose body is a single base64 blob. Closed-source backdoor inside your database.',
