VALUES (
    'SEC-SQL-RAN-060-RC01', 'SEC-SQL-RAN-060', 'RLS / compensating-control bypass',
    'ran-060-rls-compensating-control-bypass', 'row-level-security policies dropped, BYPASSRLS granted, dynamic data masking removed, Always Encrypted disabled on PII columns. Red-Gate Simple Talk''s RLS attack series documents the vectors.',
