    'ran-061-ransom-ddos-database-resource-exhaustion', 'sustained max_connections saturation, fork-bomb queries (`WITH RECURSIVE` infinite, cross-join cartesian, parallel-worker fork), long transactions bloating WAL. DoS as a prelude to or substitute for encryption-based extortion (Cloudflare, NETSCOUT, Wallarm).',
