    'ran-062-object-ownership-default-privilege-poisoning', '`ALTER TABLE ... OWNER TO` shifts critical objects to an attacker role; `ALTER DEFAULT PRIVILEGES` makes every future table auto-grant to the attacker. Survives single-account credential rotation because the ownership chain itself was modified.',
